@@ -12,6 +12,13 @@ See the [Contributing Guide](contributing.md) for details.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+* Behavior change: the footnotes extension now numbers and orders footnotes by
+  the order in which they are first referenced in the document rather than the
+  order of their definitions. Set the new `USE_DEFINITION_ORDER` option to
+  `True` to restore the previous behavior.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 * Fix handling of incomplete HTML tags in code spans in Python 3.14.
