     The text string used to set the footnote separator. Defaults to `:`.
 
+* **`USE_DEFINITION_ORDER`**:
+    Whether to order footnotes by the order of their definitions rather than
+    by the order in which they are first referenced in the document. Defaults
+    to `False`, i.e. footnotes are numbered and listed in order of first
+    reference. Footnotes which are never referenced are listed last, in
+    definition order.
